{title: Hum Tere Sheher Me Aaye Hain}
{artist: Ghulam Ali}
{key: D#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#m] [G#],        Hum Tere Shahar Mein Aaye hain
[A#] [D#m],        Musaafir Ki Tarah
[D#] [F#],        Sirf Ek Baar
[G#] [D#] [D#m],        Mulaaqaat Ka Mauqa De De
[D#m],        Meri Manzil hai kahan
[G#] [D#m],        mera Thikana hai kahan
[D#m],        Subah tak tujh se bichhad kar
[G#] [D#m],        mujhe jaana hai kahan
[D#] [G#],        Sochne ke liye ik raat ka
[D#] [D#m],        mauka dede
[D#m],        Apni Ankhon Mein Chhupa
[G#] [D#m],        Rakhein Hain Jugnu Maine
[D#m],        Apni Palkon Pe Saja
[G#] [D#m],        Rakhe hai Aansu Maine
[D#],        Meri Ankhon Ko Bhi
[G#] [D#] [D#m],        Barsaat Ka Mauqa De De
[D#m],        Aaj ki raat mera
[G#] [D#m],        dard-e-mohobbat sun le
[D#m],        Kapkapate hue honthon ki
[G#] [D#m],        shikayat sun le
[D#] [G#],        Aaj izhaar-e-khayalat
[D#] [D#m],        ka mauka de de
